  "title": "A Store for Witches and Wizards",
  "subtitle": "",
  "description": "A Witch, her Pet Raven, and her New Employee work everyday at their humble store, trying to get through another day. Welcome to A Store for Witches and Wizards! A slice of life narrative series set in a world of modern fantasy and academic whimsy. With a magic academy nearby, the store has an endless supply of patrons seeking wands, potions, components, spell books, familiars, brooms, and more! We follow Rachel, powerful witch and owner of the store, and witness her everyday juggle of managing the business, her tense relationships with other witches, and proving herself to the academy's watchful eye. As well as Max, a new employee at the store and student at the academy, trying to find their way in life and learn powerful magic. Our Website Socials: @astoreforWW YouTube Instagram Twitter TikTok",
